{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">恒生指數高開143點，報24,825點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阿里巴巴高開百分之2.46。智譜低開百分之7.26。長飛光纖光纜低開百分之7.28。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T01:38:49.086477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":63,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}